{"id":"kuzen","lemma":"кузен","pos":"noun","rank":1739,"glosses":["male cousin (any male cousin however distant)","distant male blood relative"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/18/Ru-%D0%BA%D1%83%D0%B7%D0%B5%D0%BD.ogg/Ru-%D0%BA%D1%83%D0%B7%D0%B5%D0%BD.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"кузена","plural":"кузены","feminine":"кузина"},"examples":[{"text":"Том - твой кузен, не так ли?","en":"Tom is your cousin, isn't he?","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"your"},null,null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,6,"right"]]},{"text":"«Где твой кузен?» — «Вышел только что».","en":"\"Where's your cousin?\" \"He just left.\"","words":[{"g":"where"},{"g":"your"},null,{"g":"to exit, to go out","l":"выйти"},null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"just, just now"]]},{"text":"Она завидовала успеху кузена.","en":"She was envious of her cousin's success.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},null,null,null]},{"text":"Я кузина Тома.","en":"I'm Tom's cousin.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"volume","l":"том"}]},{"text":"Я занял 1000 иен у моего кузена.","en":"I borrowed 1,000 yen from my cousin.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/71950","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to borrow","l":"занять"},null,{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"my, mine","l":"мой"},null]}]}